    {
      "id": "patch_5ca8f64228ff",
      "failure_port": "drop_frame",
      "source_line": 99,
      "mechanism": "Changes the write-domain condition from `if (write)` to `if (write && rst)`. This makes the write logic execute only when rst=1, which is the opposite of the intended reset behavior and will deadlock the FIFO. Not a viable fix. Cited failure: drop_frame=1 at cycle 13 (expected 0) — candidate anchored to same symptoms but wrong direction."
    },
