      "source_line": 100,
      "mechanism": "Restricts the drop-frame entry condition `(full | full_cur | drop_frame)` to only trigger when `input_axis_tlast` is asserted. The failure at cycle 13 occurs on a non-last beat during reset; this gate would not fire then, so it does not address the observed reset-time drop_frame assertion. Cited failure: drop_frame=1 at cycle 13 (expected 0) — condition not active at failure cycle."
    },
    {
