      "mechanism": "Qualifies `input_axis_tready` with `rst`, making the FIFO appear not-ready during reset. The trace shows drop_frame errors, not tready errors; this edit changes an output port that is not cited as failing. Cited failure: drop_frame=1 at cycle 13 (expected 0) — unrelated port."
